{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"The window is perpetually rattling in its frame, a rhythmic ticking that seems to keep time with the churning grey waters below. I have tried to read, but the pages refuse to lie flat, dancing across the desk like startled birds. It is a strange kind of isolation, being so close to the water yet so far from the noise of the city. I find myself thinking of you with a clarity that surprises me, as if the constant wind has scrubbed away the clutter of daily life and left only the essentials. I wonder if you have found that small blue vase I left on the windowsill, or if it has already joined the archive of things we no longer speak of. The train leaves at five. I do not know if I will catch it, or if I will simply stay here and let the gorse roots reclaim the car park. Write back if you can. Tell me if the light is different where you are.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792460696,"id":"chatcmpl-18e01981b2f0cc300064","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,2